Allen and Tildesley's examples (upstream, https://github.com/Allen-Tildesley/examples)
    Michael P. Allen
    Dominic J. Tildesley

The Viv port (ports/liquids, vipyr-liquids)
    Adam Zettel

The equation-of-state fits that eos.viv evaluates are those of M. Thol,
G. Rutkai, A. Koester, R. Lustig, R. Span and J. Vrabec (2015, 2016);
upstream wrote its code independently of theirs, and so does this port.
